{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"groupMappings","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK18SetDirectoryConfigV13groupMappingsSayAA12GroupMappingVGSgvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"groupMappings","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"GroupMapping","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SetDirectoryConfig"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/setdirectoryconfig\/groupmappings"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"groupMappings"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV","text":"GroupMapping"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SetDirectoryConfig\/groupMappings","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"At most 500; every ","type":"text"},{"code":"group_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" a group of the tenant. Default empty.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One row of the group-mapping table (G-3, T23.3.4, D-30): a directory group, named by its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguished name, and the AXIAM group a member of it is put into. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table is the only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"way a directory group reaches an AXIAM group."}]},{"type":"text","text":" There is no match by name, no prefix or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wildcard, and no AXIAM group is ever created from a directory one: a directory administrator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"who names a group "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"admins"},{"type":"text","text":" gains nothing unless a tenant administrator mapped it here. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"DN is stored as the administrator typed it and compared after RFC 4514 normalisation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam_directory::dn"},{"type":"text","text":"), so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CN=Staff, OU=Groups"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cn=staff,ou=groups"},{"type":"text","text":" are the same row."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"One DN may map to several AXIAM groups; the same (DN, group) pair twice is refused as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redundant."}],"title":"GroupMapping","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SetDirectoryConfig":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SetDirectoryConfig","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/setdirectoryconfig","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PUT \/api\/v1\/tenants\/{tenant_id}\/directory"},{"type":"text","text":" — a "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"replacement"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". Every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectoryConfig"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"member except "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"id"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tenant_id"},{"type":"text","text":" and the two timestamps, plus the write-only "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bind_secret"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An omitted optional member is "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"reset to its default"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", not kept."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SetDirectoryConfig","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SetDirectoryConfig","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"SetDirectoryConfig"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SetDirectoryConfig/groupMappings":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/setdirectoryconfig\/groupmappings","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"groupMappings","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"groupMappings","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"GroupMapping","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"At most 500; every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"group_id"},{"type":"text","text":" a group of the tenant. Default empty."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SetDirectoryConfig\/groupMappings"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","title":"AxiamSDK","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}]}}}